Source: wlan-device-cfg-hmt
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ben Wang <benw@qti.qualcomm.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.0
Homepage: https://git.codelinaro.org/

Package: wlan-device-cfg-hmt
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: WLAN firmware configuration files for HMT (qca6797)
 Installs WLAN firmware configuration and MAC address files for the
 qca6797 (HMT) chipset into /lib/firmware/wlan/qca_cld/qca6797/.
 .
 Includes:
  - WCNSS_qcom_cfg.ini: WLAN driver configuration
  - wlan_mac.bin: MAC address configuration
